{
    "name": "dsh-waystation",
    "version": "1.4.1",
    "description": "DSH（DeepSeek Harness）上的 Waystation 控制面板插件，配合 Matt Pocock skills（github.com/mattpocock/skills）的 wayfinder / triage / grilling / handoff 等技能使用：右侧 details 列面板（GitHub issue 地图/列表/技能/环境检查）、输入区状态栏胶囊、动作注入与交接开新会话。打开形式仅右侧 details 列（无 PiP/悬浮）。npm 标准安装（bundle 装配，一条命令即装好，无需手动注册）。",
    "type": "module",
    "main": "lib/index.js",
    "exports": {
        ".": "./lib/index.js",
        "./client": "./lib/client.js",
        "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
        "./package.json": "./package.json"
    },
    "files": [
        "lib",
        "cordis.patch.yml"
    ],
    "keywords": [
        "dsh",
        "deepseek-harness",
        "plugin",
        "wayfinder",
        "mattpocock",
        "skills",
        "github",
        "issue-tracker",
        "waystation"
    ],
    "dsh": {
        "bundle": {
            "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
        },
        "client": {
            "platform": "web",
            "immediately": true,
            "inject": []
        }
    },
    "homepage": "https://github.com/FeatherHunter/SKILLS/tree/main/dsh-plugin/dsh-waystation",
    "repository": {
        "type": "git",
        "url": "git+https://github.com/FeatherHunter/SKILLS.git"
    },
    "license": "MIT"
}
